      "name": "Rend",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>Claw</p>\n<details><summary>See rules...</summary>\n<p><p>A Rend entry lists a Strike the monster has.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The monster hit the same enemy with two consecutive Strikes of the listed type in the same round.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The monster automatically deals that Strike's damage again to the enemy.</p></p></details>",
      "collapsed": false
